    "A quick check before we ask anything else." : {

    },
    "A sentence is enough. Mirror learns from everything you write." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ein Satz genügt. Mirror lernt aus allem, was du schreibst."
